## Highlights
1. A functionalized MOF material was applied to the construction of Dam methyltransferase (MTase ) biosensor for the first time.   
2. The functionalized MOF acts as not only a well-defined electrochemical redox molecule, but also an ideal loading platform to immobilize biomolecules, which realizes dual-response detection of Dam MTase activity.   
3. Both DPV and glucometer are employed for the accurate determination of Dam MTase activity.   
4. The method shows good sensitivity with wide linear range and can be applied for inhibitor screening.
